#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Instructions to create access groups and policies to manage users"
msgstr "Arahan untuk mencipta kumpulan akses dan dasar untuk menguruskan pengguna"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create access groups and policies"
msgstr "Cipta kumpulan akses dan dasar"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create access groups and policies {#create-access-groups-and-policies}"
msgstr "Cipta kumpulan akses dan dasar {#create-access-groups-and-policies}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "When you create an instance in IBM Quantum&reg; Platform, an access group is automatically generated for collaborators to use that instance. If you want to customize that access group or create other access groups, use the IBM&reg; Cloud console for [Access groups](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/groups).\n"
msgstr "Apabila anda mencipta contoh dalam IBM Quantum&reg; Platform, kumpulan akses dijana secara automatik untuk rakan usaha sama menggunakan contoh tersebut. Jika anda ingin menyesuaikan kumpulan akses itu atau mencipta kumpulan akses lain, gunakan konsol IBM&reg; Cloud untuk [Kumpulan akses](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/groups).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "An _access group_ contains _policies_, which define the actions that access group members can take on specific resources, such as services.  In this guide, the resource is generally an IBM Quantum _service instance_.\n"
msgstr "_Kumpulan akses_ mengandungi _dasar_, yang mentakrifkan tindakan yang boleh diambil oleh ahli kumpulan akses pada sumber tertentu, seperti perkhidmatan. Dalam panduan ini, sumber umumnya adalah _contoh perkhidmatan_ IBM Quantum.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can create additional access groups by using the IBM Cloud&reg; [console](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-groups&interface=ui), [CLI](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-groups&interface=cli), [API](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-groups&interface=api), or [Terraform](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-groups&interface=terraform).\n"
msgstr "Anda boleh mencipta kumpulan akses tambahan menggunakan [konsol](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-groups&interface=ui), [CLI](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-groups&interface=cli), [API](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-groups&interface=api), atau [Terraform](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-groups&interface=terraform) IBM Cloud&reg;.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\" title=\"Important\">\n"
"To determine the actions allowed by each role, from the [IAM Roles](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/roles) page, select Quantum Compute in the dropdown menu at the top of the page.  For a more detailed list, click the number in the column next to the role name.  For example, by visiting that page and clicking the number by the Manager role, you can see that this role includes the ability to delete a job (`quantum-computing.job.delete`).\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\" title=\"Penting\">\n"
"Untuk menentukan tindakan yang dibenarkan oleh setiap peranan, dari halaman [Peranan IAM](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/roles), pilih Quantum Compute dalam menu lungsur di bahagian atas halaman. Untuk senarai yang lebih terperinci, klik nombor dalam lajur di sebelah nama peranan. Contohnya, dengan melawat halaman itu dan mengklik nombor di sebelah peranan Pengurus, anda dapat melihat bahawa peranan ini termasuk keupayaan untuk memadam kerja (`quantum-computing.job.delete`).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The [Compare pre-defined service role actions](#compare-actions) section provides a comparison of the pre-defined Manager, Writer, and Reader roles.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"Bahagian [Bandingkan tindakan peranan perkhidmatan pra-takrifkan](#compare-actions) menyediakan perbandingan peranan Pengurus, Penulis, dan Pembaca pra-takrifkan.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"create-ibm-quantum-administrators\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"create-ibm-quantum-administrators\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create an IBM Quantum Administrators access group {#create-an-ibm-quantum-administrators-access-group}"
msgstr "Cipta kumpulan akses IBM Quantum Administrators {#create-an-ibm-quantum-administrators-access-group}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "After setting up an account for your organization, it's recommended that you create an IBM Quantum Administrators access group. This access group lets other users create and manage instances, and manage user access for IBM Quantum Compute Service.\n"
msgstr "Selepas menyediakan akaun untuk organisasi anda, adalah disyorkan untuk mencipta kumpulan akses IBM Quantum Administrators. Kumpulan akses ini membolehkan pengguna lain mencipta dan mengurus contoh, serta mengurus akses pengguna untuk IBM Quantum Compute Service.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "When you create this access group, include the following policies:\n"
msgstr "Apabila mencipta kumpulan akses ini, sertakan dasar berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Quantum Compute Service - Grant access to manage all IBM Quantum instances in the account and view account usage analytics.\n"
msgstr "IBM Quantum Compute Service - Beri akses untuk mengurus semua contoh IBM Quantum dalam akaun dan melihat analitik penggunaan akaun.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Manager** service access role\n"
msgstr "Peranan akses perkhidmatan **Pengurus**\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Administrator** platform management access role\n"
msgstr "Peranan pengurusan platform **Pentadbir**\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "All account management services - Grant access to list all the resource groups in the account.\n"
msgstr "Semua perkhidmatan pengurusan akaun - Beri akses untuk menyenaraikan semua kumpulan sumber dalam akaun.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Viewer** platform management access role\n"
msgstr "Peranan pengurusan platform **Penonton**\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "All IAM Account Management services - Grant access to invite users, manage access groups, and create access policies.\n"
msgstr "Semua perkhidmatan Pengurusan Akaun IAM - Beri akses untuk menjemput pengguna, mengurus kumpulan akses, dan mencipta dasar akses.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Support Center service - Grant access to enable users to open support cases through IBM Cloud Support Center.\n"
msgstr "Perkhidmatan Support Center - Beri akses untuk membolehkan pengguna membuka kes sokongan melalui IBM Cloud Support Center.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<DoqAdmonition type=\"note\">\n"
msgstr "<DoqAdmonition type=\"note\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  Users with the `viewer` platform management role on \"all account management services\" can also view services such as billing. If you want to prevent this extra view access, use the IBM Cloud CLI to give them access to just Resource groups:\n"
msgstr "  Pengguna dengan peranan pengurusan platform `viewer` pada \"semua perkhidmatan pengurusan akaun\" juga boleh melihat perkhidmatan seperti pengebilan. Jika anda ingin mencegah akses paparan tambahan ini, gunakan IBM Cloud CLI untuk memberi mereka akses kepada kumpulan Sumber sahaja:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "</DoqAdmonition>\n"
msgstr "</DoqAdmonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Follow these examples to create an IBM Quantum Administrators access group by using the IBM Cloud CLI or console.\n"
msgstr "Ikut contoh-contoh ini untuk mencipta kumpulan akses IBM Quantum Administrators menggunakan IBM Cloud CLI atau konsol.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"cli\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"cli\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the IBM Cloud CLI {#use-the-ibm-cloud-cli}"
msgstr "Gunakan IBM Cloud CLI {#use-the-ibm-cloud-cli}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To create an _access group_ by using the CLI, use the [`ibmcloud iam access-group-create`](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cli?topic=cli-ibmcloud_commands_iam#ibmcloud_iam_access_group_policy_create) command.\n"
msgstr "Untuk mencipta _kumpulan akses_ menggunakan CLI, gunakan perintah [`ibmcloud iam access-group-create`](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cli?topic=cli-ibmcloud_commands_iam#ibmcloud_iam_access_group_policy_create).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To create an access group _policy_ by using the CLI, use the [`ibmcloud iam access-group-policy-create`](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cli?topic=cli-ibmcloud_commands_iam#ibmcloud_iam_access_group_policy_create) command.\n"
msgstr "Untuk mencipta _dasar_ kumpulan akses menggunakan CLI, gunakan perintah [`ibmcloud iam access-group-policy-create`](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cli?topic=cli-ibmcloud_commands_iam#ibmcloud_iam_access_group_policy_create).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can use the following JSON code to create policies for an Administrators access group:\n"
msgstr "Anda boleh menggunakan kod JSON berikut untuk mencipta dasar bagi kumpulan akses Pentadbir:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "All Account Management services (viewer)\n"
msgstr "Semua perkhidmatan Pengurusan Akaun (penonton)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Quantum Compute Service (Manager, Administrator)\n"
msgstr "Perkhidmatan IBM Quantum Compute (Pengurus, Pentadbir)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "All IAM Account Management services (administrator)\n"
msgstr "Semua perkhidmatan Pengurusan Akaun IAM (pentadbir)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Support Center service (administrator)\n"
msgstr "Perkhidmatan Support Center (pentadbir)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"ui\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"ui\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the IBM Cloud IAM console {#use-the-ibm-cloud-iam-console}"
msgstr "Gunakan konsol IBM Cloud IAM {#use-the-ibm-cloud-iam-console}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "As an account owner or administrator, follow these steps to create an IBM Quantum Administrator access group.\n"
msgstr "Sebagai pemilik akaun atau pentadbir, ikut langkah-langkah ini untuk mencipta kumpulan akses IBM Quantum Administrator.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Go to Manage > [Access (IAM)](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/overview) in the IBM Cloud console.\n"
msgstr "Pergi ke Urus > [Akses (IAM)](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/overview) dalam konsol IBM Cloud.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "On the left panel in the **Manage access** section, click **Access groups**, then click **Create**.\n"
msgstr "Pada panel kiri dalam bahagian **Urus akses**, klik **Kumpulan akses**, kemudian klik **Cipta**.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "In the **Create access group** window that opens, add a name and description that represent the group of users that you will invite.  For example, IBM Quantum Administrators. Click **Create**.\n"
msgstr "Dalam tetingkap **Cipta kumpulan akses** yang terbuka, tambah nama dan keterangan yang mewakili kumpulan pengguna yang akan anda jemput. Contohnya, IBM Quantum Administrators. Klik **Cipta**.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Next, create policies for IBM Quantum Compute Service, for All IAM Account Management services, and for All Account Management services.\n"
"1. In the access group just created, click the **Access** tab, then click **Assign access**.\n"
"1. In the **Create policy** page that opens, define these elements:\n"
"   - **Service** - Search for Quantum Compute and select it. Click **Next**.\n"
"   - **Resources** - Select **All resources**. Click **Next**.\n"
"      Note: If you were creating a policy that you want to apply only to a certain instance, you would instead choose **Specific resources**, **Service instance**, **string equals**, then select the instance.\n"
"   - **Roles and actions** - Select the following values:\n"
"      - For **Service access**, select  **Manager**.\n"
"      - For **Platform access**, select **Administrator**.\n"
msgstr ""
"Seterusnya, cipta dasar untuk IBM Quantum Compute Service, untuk Semua Perkhidmatan Pengurusan Akaun IAM, dan untuk Semua Perkhidmatan Pengurusan Akaun.\n"
"1. Dalam kumpulan akses yang baru dicipta, klik tab **Akses**, kemudian klik **Tugaskan akses**.\n"
"1. Dalam halaman **Cipta dasar** yang terbuka, takrifkan elemen-elemen ini:\n"
"   - **Perkhidmatan** - Cari Quantum Compute dan pilihnya. Klik **Seterusnya**.\n"
"   - **Sumber** - Pilih **Semua sumber**. Klik **Seterusnya**.\n"
"      Nota: Jika anda mencipta dasar yang ingin anda terapkan hanya pada contoh tertentu, anda akan memilih **Sumber tertentu**, **Contoh perkhidmatan**, **rentetan sama dengan**, kemudian pilih contoh itu.\n"
"   - **Peranan dan tindakan** - Pilih nilai berikut:\n"
"      - Untuk **Akses perkhidmatan**, pilih **Pengurus**.\n"
"      - Untuk **Akses platform**, pilih **Pentadbir**.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "   At the bottom, click **Add**. You should see the policy on the right-hand panel. Click **Assign** at the bottom of that panel.\n"
msgstr "   Di bahagian bawah, klik **Tambah**. Anda sepatutnya melihat dasar pada panel sebelah kanan. Klik **Tugaskan** di bahagian bawah panel itu.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You have successfully created an access group with one policy.  Next, create a second policy for the same instance.\n"
msgstr "Anda berjaya mencipta kumpulan akses dengan satu dasar. Seterusnya, cipta dasar kedua untuk contoh yang sama.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "In the same access group, click the **Access** tab, then click **Assign access**.\n"
msgstr "Dalam kumpulan akses yang sama, klik tab **Akses**, kemudian klik **Tugaskan akses**.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "In the **Create policy** page that opens, define these elements:\n"
msgstr "Dalam halaman **Cipta dasar** yang terbuka, takrifkan elemen-elemen ini:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Service** - Select **All IAM Account Management services**. Click **Next**.\n"
msgstr "**Perkhidmatan** - Pilih **Semua Perkhidmatan Pengurusan Akaun IAM**. Klik **Seterusnya**.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   - **Roles and actions** - For Platform access, select **Administrator**, Click **Next**.\n"
"   At the bottom, click **Add**, then click **Assign**.\n"
msgstr ""
"   - **Peranan dan tindakan** - Untuk Akses platform, pilih **Pentadbir**, Klik **Seterusnya**.\n"
"   Di bahagian bawah, klik **Tambah**, kemudian klik **Tugaskan**.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a third policy for the same instance.\n"
msgstr "Cipta dasar ketiga untuk contoh yang sama.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Service** - Select **All Account Management services**. Click **Next**.\n"
msgstr "**Perkhidmatan** - Pilih **Semua Perkhidmatan Pengurusan Akaun**. Klik **Seterusnya**.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   - **Roles and actions** - For Platform access, select **Viewer**, Click **Next**.\n"
"   At the bottom, click **Add**, then click **Assign**.\n"
msgstr ""
"   - **Peranan dan tindakan** - Untuk Akses platform, pilih **Penonton**, Klik **Seterusnya**.\n"
"   Di bahagian bawah, klik **Tambah**, kemudian klik **Tugaskan**.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a fourth policy for the same instance.\n"
msgstr "Cipta dasar keempat untuk contoh yang sama.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Service** - Select **Support Center**. Click **Next**.\n"
msgstr "**Perkhidmatan** - Pilih **Support Center**. Klik **Seterusnya**.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   - **Roles and actions** - For Platform access, select **Administrator**. Click **Next**.\n"
"   At the bottom, click **Add**, then click **Assign**.\n"
msgstr ""
"   - **Peranan dan tindakan** - Untuk Akses platform, pilih **Pentadbir**. Klik **Seterusnya**.\n"
"   Di bahagian bawah, klik **Tambah**, kemudian klik **Tugaskan**.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Finally, add users to the access group.  You can do this from the access group's **Users** page, or by using the IBM Quantum Platform [Access management](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/access-groups) page.\n"
msgstr "Akhirnya, tambah pengguna ke kumpulan akses. Anda boleh melakukannya dari halaman **Pengguna** kumpulan akses, atau menggunakan halaman [Pengurusan akses](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/access-groups) IBM Quantum Platform.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"You can only invite users who are already members of the account.  If you don't see a user on the Add users page, follow the steps in [Invite and manage users](/guides/invite-and-manage-users#invite) to add them to the account first.  After they accept the invitation, you can add them to the access group.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Anda hanya boleh menjemput pengguna yang sudah menjadi ahli akaun. Jika anda tidak melihat pengguna pada halaman Tambah pengguna, ikut langkah dalam [Jemput dan urus pengguna](/guides/invite-and-manage-users#invite) untuk menambah mereka ke akaun terlebih dahulu. Selepas mereka menerima jemputan, anda boleh menambah mereka ke kumpulan akses.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Compare permissions {#compare-permissions}"
msgstr "Bandingkan kebenaran {#compare-permissions}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following table displays which permissions are granted to three entities: account owners, IBM Quantum Administrators (see the [Create an IBM Quantum Administrators access group](#create-ibm-quantum-administrators) section), and instance collaborators (a \"Collaborators\" access group is automatically generated whenever you create an instance using IBM Quantum Platform).\n"
msgstr "Jadual berikut memaparkan kebenaran yang diberikan kepada tiga entiti: pemilik akaun, IBM Quantum Administrators (lihat bahagian [Cipta kumpulan akses IBM Quantum Administrators](#create-ibm-quantum-administrators)), dan rakan usaha sama contoh (kumpulan akses \"Rakan usaha sama\" dijana secara automatik apabila anda mencipta contoh menggunakan IBM Quantum Platform).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Key:\n"
msgstr "Kunci:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "✅ Has permission\n"
msgstr "✅ Mempunyai kebenaran\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "✴️ Involves a dependency\n"
msgstr "✴️ Melibatkan kebergantungan\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "❌ Does not have permission\n"
msgstr "❌ Tidak mempunyai kebenaran\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Permissions | Account owner | IBM Quantum Administrators (access group) | Instance collaborators (access group) |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| Full access to all IBM Cloud resources | ✅| ✅ (*Only to Quantum Compute instances*)| ❌ (*Only to a particular Quantum Compute instance*)| \n"
"| Assign access to others | ✅| ✅ (*Only to IBM Quantum Compute Service*)| ❌| \n"
"| Create service instances  | ✅ (*All IBM Cloud catalog*)| ✅ (*Only Quantum Compute instances*)| ❌| \n"
"| View all users | ✅| ✅| ✴️ (*Depends on user visibility settings*)| \n"
"| Set user visibility | ✅| ❌| ❌| \n"
"| Invite users to the account | ✅| ✅| ❌| \n"
"| Billing responsibility | ✅| ❌| ❌| \n"
"| View billing information | ✅| ✅| ❌| \n"
"| Owner notifications | ✅| ❌| ❌| \n"
"| Submit quantum workloads | ✅ (*On all Quantum Compute instances*)| ✅ (*On all Quantum Compute instances*)| ✅ (*Only on a particular Quantum Compute instance*) | \n"
"| View quantum workloads | ✅ (*On all Quantum Compute instances*)| ✅ (*On all Quantum Compute instances*)| ✅ (*Only on a particular Quantum Compute instance*)| \n"
"| Cancel quantum workloads | ✅ (*On all Quantum Compute instances*)| ✅ (*On all Quantum Compute instances*)| ✅ (*Only on a particular Quantum Compute instance*)| \n"
"| Delete quantum workloads | ✅ (*On all Quantum Compute instances*)| ✅ (*On all Quantum Compute instances*) | ❌| \n"
"| Create support cases | ✅| ✅ (*If the access policy is included in the access group*) | ✅ (*If the access group gives access to a Premium Plan instance*)| \n"
"| Configure an [identity provider](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/identity-providers) to connect your external user repositories to your IBM Cloud account | ✅| ❌| ❌| \n"
msgstr ""
"| Kebenaran | Pemilik akaun | IBM Quantum Administrators (kumpulan akses) | Rakan usaha sama contoh (kumpulan akses) |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| Akses penuh ke semua sumber IBM Cloud | ✅| ✅ (*Hanya ke contoh Quantum Compute*)| ❌ (*Hanya ke contoh Quantum Compute tertentu*)| \n"
"| Tugaskan akses kepada orang lain | ✅| ✅ (*Hanya ke Perkhidmatan IBM Quantum Compute*)| ❌| \n"
"| Cipta contoh perkhidmatan  | ✅ (*Semua katalog IBM Cloud*)| ✅ (*Hanya contoh Quantum Compute*)| ❌| \n"
"| Lihat semua pengguna | ✅| ✅| ✴️ (*Bergantung pada tetapan keterlihatan pengguna*)| \n"
"| Tetapkan keterlihatan pengguna | ✅| ❌| ❌| \n"
"| Jemput pengguna ke akaun | ✅| ✅| ❌| \n"
"| Tanggungjawab pengebilan | ✅| ❌| ❌| \n"
"| Lihat maklumat pengebilan | ✅| ✅| ❌| \n"
"| Pemberitahuan pemilik | ✅| ❌| ❌| \n"
"| Hantar beban kerja kuantum | ✅ (*Pada semua contoh Quantum Compute*)| ✅ (*Pada semua contoh Quantum Compute*)| ✅ (*Hanya pada contoh Quantum Compute tertentu*) | \n"
"| Lihat beban kerja kuantum | ✅ (*Pada semua contoh Quantum Compute*)| ✅ (*Pada semua contoh Quantum Compute*)| ✅ (*Hanya pada contoh Quantum Compute tertentu*)| \n"
"| Batalkan beban kerja kuantum | ✅ (*Pada semua contoh Quantum Compute*)| ✅ (*Pada semua contoh Quantum Compute*)| ✅ (*Hanya pada contoh Quantum Compute tertentu*)| \n"
"| Padam beban kerja kuantum | ✅ (*Pada semua contoh Quantum Compute*)| ✅ (*Pada semua contoh Quantum Compute*) | ❌| \n"
"| Cipta kes sokongan | ✅| ✅ (*Jika dasar akses disertakan dalam kumpulan akses*) | ✅ (*Jika kumpulan akses memberi akses ke contoh Plan Premium*)| \n"
"| Konfigurasi [pembekal identiti](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/identity-providers) untuk menyambungkan repositori pengguna luaran anda ke akaun IBM Cloud anda | ✅| ❌| ❌| \n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"compare-actions\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"compare-actions\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Compare pre-defined service role actions {#compare-pre-defined-service-role-actions}"
msgstr "Bandingkan tindakan peranan perkhidmatan pra-takrifkan {#compare-pre-defined-service-role-actions}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following table displays examples of actions that can be taken by the pre-defined service role actions: Manager, Writer, and Reader. To see a complete mapping of Quantum Service roles to actions, visit [this table](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-iam-service-roles-actions#quantum-computing-roles) in the IBM Cloud Product guide.\n"
msgstr "Jadual berikut memaparkan contoh tindakan yang boleh diambil oleh tindakan peranan perkhidmatan pra-takrifkan: Pengurus, Penulis, dan Pembaca. Untuk melihat pemetaan lengkap peranan Perkhidmatan Quantum kepada tindakan, lawati [jadual ini](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-iam-service-roles-actions#quantum-computing-roles) dalam panduan Produk IBM Cloud.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Action | Description | Roles |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| `quantum-computing.session.create` | Create a Session/Batch | Manager, Writer |\n"
"| `quantum-computing.job.create` | Submit a Job | Manager, Writer |\n"
"| `quantum-computing.job.read` | Read a result | Manager, Reader, Writer |\n"
"| `quantum-computing.job.cancel` | Cancel a job | Manager, Writer |\n"
"| `quantum-computing.job.delete` | Delete a job | Manager |\n"
"| `quantum-computing.direct-access-backend-properties.read` | Read QPU calibrations | Manager, Reader, Writer |\n"
"| `quantum-computing.account-analytics-usage.read` | See account analytics | Manager, Writer (*Only if role is set up for all resources*) |\n"
"| `quantum-computing.instance-usage.read` | See instance usage and remaining time | Manager, Reader, Writer |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Tindakan | Keterangan | Peranan |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| `quantum-computing.session.create` | Cipta Session/Batch | Pengurus, Penulis |\n"
"| `quantum-computing.job.create` | Hantar Kerja | Pengurus, Penulis |\n"
"| `quantum-computing.job.read` | Baca keputusan | Pengurus, Pembaca, Penulis |\n"
"| `quantum-computing.job.cancel` | Batalkan kerja | Pengurus, Penulis |\n"
"| `quantum-computing.job.delete` | Padam kerja | Pengurus |\n"
"| `quantum-computing.direct-access-backend-properties.read` | Baca kalibrasi QPU | Pengurus, Pembaca, Penulis |\n"
"| `quantum-computing.account-analytics-usage.read` | Lihat analitik akaun | Pengurus, Penulis (*Hanya jika peranan ditetapkan untuk semua sumber*) |\n"
"| `quantum-computing.instance-usage.read` | Lihat penggunaan contoh dan masa yang tinggal | Pengurus, Pembaca, Penulis |\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Langkah seterusnya {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"   - Understand the [IBM Cloud account structure](/guides/cloud-account-structure), including access policies, groups, and roles.\n"
"   - Read about [how IBM Cloud IAM works](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-iamoverview).\n"
"   - Read more about how to [set up access groups](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-groups&interface=ui).\n"
"   - Understand the the [IAM Roles](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/roles) (select Quantum Compute from the dropdown at the top of the page).\n"
"   - Learn about [creating custom roles](/guides/custom-roles).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Cadangan\">\n"
"   - Fahami [struktur akaun IBM Cloud](/guides/cloud-account-structure), termasuk dasar akses, kumpulan, dan peranan.\n"
"   - Baca tentang [cara IBM Cloud IAM berfungsi](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-iamoverview).\n"
"   - Baca lebih lanjut tentang cara [menyediakan kumpulan akses](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-groups&interface=ui).\n"
"   - Fahami [Peranan IAM](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/roles) (pilih Quantum Compute dari lungsur di bahagian atas halaman).\n"
"   - Ketahui tentang [mencipta peranan khusus](/guides/custom-roles).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
